{"shortDescription":"Bagsværd, Denmark, 5 October 2026 – On 6 May 2026, Novo Nordisk initiated a share repurchase programme in accordance with Article 5 of Regulation No 596/2014 of the European Parliament and Council of 16 April 2014 (MAR) and the Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2016/1052 of 8 March 2016 (the \"Sa…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Bagsværd, Denmark, 5 October 2026"]}," – On 6 May 2026, Novo Nordisk initiated a share repurchase programme in accordance with Article 5 of Regulation No 596/2014 of the European Parliament and Council of 16 April 2014 (MAR) and the Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2016/1052 of 8 March 2016 (the \"Safe Harbour Rules\"). This programme is part of the overall share repurchase programme of up to DKK 15 billion to be executed during a 12-month period beginning 4 February 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["Under the programme initiated 6 May 2026, Novo Nordisk will repurchase B shares for an amount up to DKK 11,200,000,010.45 in the period from 6 May 2026 to 1 February 2027."]},{"type":"p","children":["Since the announcement 28 September, the following transactions have been made:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[" "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Number of "]}]},{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["B shares"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Average "]}]},{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["purchase price"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Transaction "]}]},{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["value, DKK"]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Accumulated, last announcement"]}]},{"type":